From mtmorgan at fhcrc.org  Fri Aug 12 05:34:03 2011
From: mtmorgan at fhcrc.org (Martin Morgan)
Date: Thu, 11 Aug 2011 20:34:03 -0700
Subject: [Bioc-sig-seq] assess how many duplicated reads
In-Reply-To: <806E483E7E5A1E4CA78AC236E1F3324F3C63D97F@SRV321.genomichealth.com>
References: <806E483E7E5A1E4CA78AC236E1F3324F3C63D97F@SRV321.genomichealth.com>
